    icekylinx (PR645 and other work), Dominik Scholz (PR569/571),
    Jonathan Capalbo (PR567/575), Dugongue (PR541/548/552 and other work),
    Rohan Arun (PR559 and other work), and the full predecessor
    lineage. CONTRIBUTORS.md records parallel and research contributions,
    including artuskg. Cite constituent PRs where their results are used;
    preserve their licenses and assistance disclosures.
